  "result": "**No.** The repo has no two-approval rule. The only mention is the brief `docs/use-cases/UC-1-bulk-approval.md` (line 17): \"Invoices over $1,000 need a second approver.\" That is a proposed feature, not implemented.\n\n`ApprovalService.Approve` (`backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs:31`) moves an invoice straight to `Approved` on one call and stores one `DecidedBy`. Nothing checks for a second approver or compares approvers.\n\n\"The same person\" is not defined anywhere. The controller passes the signed-in username as a plain string (`ApprovalsController.cs:23`), and the domain never compares it to anything.",
